      "extract": "Initially, all the cavities are empty and all ensemble atoms are in the reservoir state $\\left|s\\ldots s\\right\\rangle$. The first step consists in entangling pairs of neighboring subnodes $\\left(R_{k},L_{k+1}\\right)$ (see Fig. [\\[Fig1\\]](#Fig1){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"Fig1\"}c). To this end, one applies the sequence of operations given in Table [1](#EntanglementGeneration){reference-type=\"ref\"",
