      "extract": "In this paper we proposed a quantum repeater scenario based on Rydberg blocked ensembles placed in cavities which are linked by optical fibers. Entanglement generation between two neighboring nodes is performed in a heralded way by the transmission of a photon whose polarization is entangled with the state of the first atomic ensemble, followed by its absorption by the neighboring atomic ensemble. Photon losses and",
